<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan three-month NCDs yield at 4.850 percent.</title>
<headline>Taiwan three-month NCDs yield at 4.850 percent.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$10 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposits on Monday at an average yield of 4.850 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the yields was between 4.80 and 4.90 percent. Demand totalled T$33 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
